    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your brain with this clever rabbit puzzle game full of strategy and charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you\u2019ll guide a group of bunnies as they hop over each other into a single hole \u2014 but their jumps are limited, so every move must be planned with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and timing to create the perfect chain of hops. Think it\u2019s simple? Think again! The world is alive with obstacles and helpers \u2014 squirrels, tree barks, and water lilies offer moving rides across ponds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is a test of wit and planning, with fun mechanics that grow as you play. Whether you\u2019re hopping past hazards or using nature to your advantage, each level offers a new challenge to solve. Perfect for fans of thoughtful, grid-based puzzles with a fresh twist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your brain with this clever rabbit puzzle game full of strategy and charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you\u2019ll guide a group of bunnies as they hop over each other into a single hole \u2014 but their jumps are limited, so every move must be planned with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and timing to create the perfect chain of hops. Think it\u2019s simple? Think again! The world is alive with obstacles and helpers \u2014 squirrels, tree barks, and water lilies offer moving rides across ponds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is a test of wit and planning, with fun mechanics that grow as you play. Whether you\u2019re hopping past hazards or using nature to your advantage, each level offers a new challenge to solve. Perfect for fans of thoughtful, grid-based puzzles with a fresh twist!</p>",
    "short_description": "Guide clever rabbits into one hole using smart hops and limited moves. Plan each jump carefully \u2014 squirrels, logs, and lily pads add fun twists! Use obstacles wisely to solve unique puzzles that blend logic, timing, and strategy.",
